PIPELINE_HELP = """<details id="rag-pipeline-details" class="rounded-xl border border-white/10 p-4">
<summary class="cursor-pointer text-sm font-medium">How the RAG Pipeline Works</summary>
<ol class="mt-3 flex flex-col gap-3 text-sm text-[#A0B0C8] leading-relaxed">
<li><strong class="text-[#EEF2F8]">1. Local ingestion:</strong> Documents become Markdown sections with source metadata. Installed local embedding models add vectors.</li>
<li><strong class="text-[#EEF2F8]">2. Retrieval:</strong> The Decision Router chooses defaults. BM25 keyword search and vector similarity can be combined with Reciprocal Rank Fusion (RRF); the controls above override those defaults.</li>
<li><strong class="text-[#EEF2F8]">3. Grounded answers:</strong> Retrieved passages are escaped and marked as untrusted context. The chosen AI receives selected passages and recent chat history, subject to the local-only lock and cloud budget guard.</li>
<li><strong class="text-[#EEF2F8]">4. Review:</strong> Citations link back to the source. With no matching passages, the app refuses generation. Privacy audits measure patterns and retrieval diagnostics, not AI answer accuracy or legal compliance.</li>
</ol></details>"""

